Doom64-Retribution/d64r-gallery-orbit-sweep.pk3
Doom64-Retribution/d64r-gallery-yaw-sweep.pk3
Doom64-Retribution/d64r-gallery-spawn-*.pk3
Doom64-Retribution/d64r-gallery-wall-ab.pk3
Doom64-Retribution/d64r-texgallery-batches-mapinfo.pk3

